{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09050","headline":"寄令狐侍郎 · 韦应物","name":"寄令狐侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三山有琼树，霜雪色逾新。\n始自风尘交，中结绸缪姻。\n西掖方掌诰，南宫复司春。\n夕燕华池月，朝奉玉阶尘。\n衆宝归和氏，吹嘘多俊人。\n羣公共然诺，声问迈时伦。\n孤鸿既高举，燕雀在荆榛。\n翔集且不同，岂不欲殷勤。\n一旦迁南郡，江湖渺无垠。\n宠辱良未定，君子岂缁磷。\n寒暑已推斥，别离生苦辛。\n非将会面目，书札何由申。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}